<title>POLAND: Sokolow Q1 net rises to PLN 1.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Sokolow Q1 net rises to PLN 1.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sokolow preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    profit on economic activities	3.11 vs    1.91</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   3.11 vs    1.91</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.76 vs    1.10</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Sokolowskie Zaklady Miesne Sokolow SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 60.42 vs   51.39</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  50.65 vs   49.97</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na  vs    na</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.35 vs    0.60</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs     na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     2.78 vs    0.35</p>
<p>    financial costs			  3.05 vs    0.16</p>
<p>    investment				 1.81 vs    1.33</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
